# text = Having turned the chair with its back towards us , he jumped into it on his knees , and excitedly addressed his small congregation of three from an impromptu pulpit began Pesca ( who always said " good dears " when he meant " worthy friends said my mother , humouring the joke whispered Sarah continued Pesca , vehemently apostrophising my unworthy self over the top rail of the chair I answered as doggedly as possible ; for the least encouragement in connection with this subject invariably let loose the Professor's emotions in a flood of tears persisted Pesca cried the enthusiastic little man at the top of his voice
