# text = My sister reminded me that this gentleman had expressly placed his services at my disposal , during the present season , in case I wished to leave town ; my mother seriously appealed to me not to let an idle caprice stand in the way of my own interests and my own health ; and Pesca piteously entreated that I would not wound him to the heart by rejecting the first grateful offer of service that he had been able to make to the friend who had saved his life .
