# text = It is hard to see that the lower part of the face is too delicately refined away towards the chin to be in full and fair proportion with the upper part ; that the nose , in escaping the aquiline bend ( always hard and cruel in a woman , no matter how abstractedly perfect it may be ), has erred a little in the other extreme , and has missed the ideal straightness of line ; and that the sweet , sensitive lips are subject to a slight nervous contraction , when she smiles , which draws them upward a little at one corner , towards the cheek .
