# text = It was part of my service to live in the very light of her eyes -- at one time to be bending over her , so close to her bosom as to tremble at the thought of touching it ; at another , to feel her bending over me , bending so close to see what I was about , that her voice sank low when she spoke to me , and her ribbons brushed my cheek in the wind before she could draw them back .
