# text = I tried hard , as I felt this , to possess myself of all my resources ; I did my utmost to turn the few moments for reflection to the best account I said , as soon as I thought it time to speak again she asked , without noticing what I had just said to her Her pale face brightened as she repeated the words , her wandering eyes fixed on me with a sudden interest she said , looking at me eagerly , without a shadow of its former distrust left in her expression .
