# text = She made me twice repeat the promise to live with her when she was married , and then suddenly asked a question which turned my sorrow and my sympathy for her into a new direction she said Her altered tone -- the abrupt manner in which she looked away from me and hid her face on my shoulder -- the hesitation which silenced her before she had completed her question , all told me , but too plainly , to whom the half-expressed inquiry pointed I said gently she persisted I replied I hesitated .
