# text = We were all at lunch , in the room with the new French windows that open into the verandah , and the Count ( who devours pastry as I have never yet seen it devoured by any human beings but girls at boarding-schools ) had just amused us by asking gravely for his fourth tart -- when the servant entered to announce the visitor Sir Percival started , and looked at the man with an expression of angry alarm he repeated , as if he thought his own ears must have deceived him He left the table the instant the last answer was given , and hurried out of the room without saying a word to any of us asked Laura , appealing to me was all I could say in reply .
