# text = Just as I was on the point of following them he made a sign with his hand , and spoke to me , before I passed him , in the oddest manner he said , quietly answering the unexpressed idea at that moment in my mind , as if I had plainly confided it to him in so many words I was on the point of answering but the vicious cockatoo ruffled his clipped wings and gave a screech that set all my nerves on edge in an instant , and made me only too glad to get out of the room .
