# text = My distrust of his unfathomable falseness , my sense of my own degradation in stooping to conciliate his wife and himself , so disturbed and confused me , that the next words failed on my lips , and I stood there in silence With that polite speech he took my hand -- oh , how I despise myself ! oh , how little comfort there is even in knowing that I submitted to it for Laura's sake !-- he took my hand and put it to his poisonous lips .
