# text = The coming in here from the bedroom , with my pen and ink and paper , before sunrise -- the sitting down at the widely - opened window to get all the air I could to cool me -- the ceaseless writing , faster and faster , hotter and hotter , driving on more and more wakefully , all through the dreadful interval before the house was astir again -- how clearly I recall it , from the beginning by candle-light , to the end on the page before this , in the sunshine of the new day !
