# text = My dread that he might yet discover it , if I allowed him any more time to think , stimulated me to such an amazing degree , that I struggled into a sitting position -- seized , really seized , the writing materials by my side , and produced the letter as rapidly as if I had been a common clerk in an office I handed these lines , at arm's length , to the Count -- I sank back in my chair -- I said He made another speech -- the man was absolutely inexhaustible .
