# text = I will merely mention that her manners were , not perhaps unpleasantly reserved , but only remarkably quiet and retiring -- that she looked about her a great deal , and said very little , which might have arisen quite as much from her own modesty as from distrust of her position at Blackwater Park ; and that she declined to partake of supper ( which was curious perhaps , but surely not suspicious ?), although I myself politely invited her to that meal in my own room .
