# text = It was the first time the story of Laura and the story of Marian had been presented to me from a stranger's point of view -- the first time the terrible obstacles that lay across our path had been made to show themselves in their true character I said interposed Mr . Kyrle I urged He looked at me with a half-suppressed pity , and shook his head he said I was determined to believe that there WAS a case , and in that determination shifted my ground , and appealed to him once more I asked he replied I considered .
