# text = The ruffianly side of him must have been uppermost , I suppose , when he got my letter , for he wrote back , refusing me in such abominably insolent language , that I lost all command over myself , and abused him , in my daughter's presence , as I said no more about him than that , being brought to my senses as soon as those words had escaped me by the sight of my daughter's face looking eagerly and curiously at mine .
