# text = Considering the subject only as a reader of newspapers , cases recurred to my memory , both in London and in Paris , of foreigners found stabbed in the streets , whose assassins could never be traced -- of bodies and parts of bodies thrown into the Thames and the Seine , by hands that could never be discovered -- of deaths by secret violence which could only be accounted for in one way .
